## ✅ Performance-Conscious Code

- SvelteKit's build process and code-splitting help optimize performance
- Minimize file sizes and dependencies
- Lazy-load assets and components when possible
- Avoid large libraries or redundant scripts
- Inline critical styles if appropriate
